{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Brieform — 30-second presentation</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f3eb}*{box-sizing:border-box}#root{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f3eb}.clip{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}text{fill:#18292b}.muted{fill:#667571}.blue{fill:#2858ed}.white{fill:#fff}.headline{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-6px}.small{font-size:27px}.label{font-size:30px;font-weight:600}.body{font-size:37px}.hairline{stroke:#d8dfd7;stroke-width:2}.scene{opacity:0}.card{fill:#fff;stroke:#dce1d9;stroke-width:2}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"main\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-duration=\"30\">\n<div class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"30\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brieform presentation: describe a form in your AI, share the published form, and read responses in the conversation.\">\n<defs>\n <pattern id=\"dots\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#b7c3b7\" opacity=\".42\"/></pattern>\n <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-30%\" y=\"-30%\" width=\"160%\" height=\"180%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"22\" stdDeviation=\"25\" flood-color=\"#203932\" flood-opacity=\".09\"/></filter>\n <clipPath id=\"prompt-mask\"><rect id=\"prompt-reveal\" x=\"154\" y=\"492\" width=\"0\" height=\"120\"/></clipPath>\n <clipPath id=\"hero-mask\"><rect x=\"100\" y=\"265\" width=\"1110\" height=\"360\"/></clipPath>\n <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"12\" markerHeight=\"12\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M1 1 L7 5 L1 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2858ed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></marker>\n</defs>\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#f5f3eb\"/>\n<rect id=\"texture\" x=\"1030\" y=\"0\" width=\"890\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"url(#dots)\"/>\n<circle id=\"ambient\" cx=\"1770\" cy=\"900\" r=\"390\" fill=\"#e5ebd9\"/>\n<path id=\"ambient-line\" d=\"M1550 -120 C1100 150 1820 540 1450 1180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dce4d5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g id=\"brand\"><text x=\"114\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"-2\">Brieform<tspan fill=\"#2858ed\">.</tspan></text></g>\n\n<!-- Opening: a sentence becomes an organized form. -->\n<g id=\"s1\" class=\"scene\">\n <g clip-path=\"url(#hero-mask)\"><g id=\"hero-title\"><text x=\"110\" y=\"397\" font-size=\"125\" class=\"headline\">Forms built</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"540\" font-size=\"125\" class=\"headline\">in conversation.</text></g></g>\n <text id=\"hero-sub\" x=\"117\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"37\" class=\"muted\">Meet the form builder inside your AI.</text>\n <g id=\"hero-pill\"><rect x=\"116\" y=\"737\" width=\"434\" height=\"72\" rx=\"36\" fill=\"#e4e9dc\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"773\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"783\" class=\"small\">Describe. Share. Read.</text></g>\n <g id=\"hero-art\">\n  <rect x=\"1247\" y=\"268\" width=\"475\" height=\"567\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"#dfe6d2\" transform=\"rotate(9 1484 551)\"/>\n  <rect x=\"1224\" y=\"257\" width=\"475\" height=\"567\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"#dce5ff\" transform=\"rotate(-7 1461 540)\"/>\n  <g filter=\"url(#shadow)\"><rect x=\"1207\" y=\"244\" width=\"475\" height=\"567\" rx=\"35\" class=\"card\"/></g>\n  <rect x=\"1248\" y=\"293\" width=\"61\" height=\"61\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/>\n  <path d=\"M1265 313 H1292 M1265 326 H1285 M1265 339 H1292\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <text x=\"1249\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"38\" font-weight=\"700\">Your next form</text>\n  <g id=\"hero-fields\"><rect x=\"1249\" y=\"460\" width=\"387\" height=\"65\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f3ed\"/><rect x=\"1249\" y=\"548\" width=\"387\" height=\"65\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f3ed\"/><rect x=\"1249\" y=\"636\" width=\"387\" height=\"65\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f3ed\"/></g>\n  <rect x=\"1249\" y=\"735\" width=\"163\" height=\"29\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/>\n </g>\n</g>\n\n<!-- Describe: conceptual workflow artwork, not a product screenshot. -->\n<g id=\"s2\" class=\"scene\">\n <g id=\"describe-copy\"><text x=\"114\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"84\" class=\"headline\" letter-spacing=\"-4\">Describe the form.</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"365\" class=\"body muted\">In Claude, ChatGPT or Cursor.</text></g>\n <g id=\"prompt-card\"><rect x=\"115\" y=\"447\" width=\"810\" height=\"245\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#18292b\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"492\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#a8b9ac\" style=\"fill:#a8b9ac\">YOUR REQUEST</text><g clip-path=\"url(#prompt-mask)\"><text x=\"155\" y=\"551\" font-size=\"40\" class=\"white\">Create a client intake form</text><text x=\"155\" y=\"609\" font-size=\"40\" class=\"white\">with budget and timeline.</text></g><circle cx=\"870\" cy=\"645\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/><path d=\"M870 654 V636 M862 644 L870 636 L878 644\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g>\n <path id=\"build-link\" d=\"M943 567 H1065\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2858ed\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n <g id=\"build-card\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"><rect x=\"1108\" y=\"227\" width=\"680\" height=\"652\" rx=\"32\" class=\"card\"/>\n  <text x=\"1157\" y=\"307\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\">Client intake</text><text x=\"1157\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"26\" class=\"muted\">Tell us about your project.</text>\n  <g class=\"build-field\"><text x=\"1157\" y=\"420\" class=\"small\">Full name</text><rect x=\"1157\" y=\"442\" width=\"582\" height=\"64\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#f4f5f0\" stroke=\"#dce1d9\"/></g>\n  <g class=\"build-field\"><text x=\"1157\" y=\"556\" class=\"small\">Budget</text><rect x=\"1157\" y=\"578\" width=\"582\" height=\"64\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#f4f5f0\" stroke=\"#dce1d9\"/><path d=\"M1699 603 L1708 612 L1717 603\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#667571\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g>\n  <g class=\"build-field\"><text x=\"1157\" y=\"692\" class=\"small\">Timeline</text><rect x=\"1157\" y=\"714\" width=\"582\" height=\"64\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#f4f5f0\" stroke=\"#dce1d9\"/></g>\n  <g id=\"ready\"><circle cx=\"1171\" cy=\"827\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#e4ecd7\"/><path d=\"M1165 827 L1169 831 L1177 823\" stroke=\"#3b693a\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"1197\" y=\"836\" font-size=\"25\" class=\"muted\">Built from your description</text></g>\n </g>\n <text id=\"describe-footer\" x=\"118\" y=\"808\" font-size=\"32\" class=\"muted\">Your words become fields.</text>\n</g>\n\n<!-- Share: a real hosted web form, presented as a diagram. -->\n<g id=\"s3\" class=\"scene\">\n <g id=\"share-copy\"><text x=\"114\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"89\" class=\"headline\">Share a real form.</text><text x=\"119\" y=\"366\" class=\"body muted\">One link. Ready for people to fill in.</text></g>\n <g id=\"share-url\"><rect x=\"117\" y=\"450\" width=\"705\" height=\"128\" rx=\"26\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/><g transform=\"translate(160 492)\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 7 L25 0 A12 12 0 0 1 42 17 L34 25 M25 34 L17 42 A12 12 0 0 1 0 25 L7 18 M13 29 L29 13\"/></g><text x=\"234\" y=\"529\" font-size=\"44\" class=\"white\" font-weight=\"600\">Your published form</text></g>\n <g id=\"share-options\"><text x=\"120\" y=\"663\" font-size=\"31\" class=\"muted\">Send the link</text><circle cx=\"371\" cy=\"653\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#a8b3a4\"/><text x=\"406\" y=\"663\" font-size=\"31\" class=\"muted\">Embed it</text><circle cx=\"597\" cy=\"653\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#a8b3a4\"/><text x=\"632\" y=\"663\" font-size=\"31\" class=\"muted\">Share a QR</text></g>\n <path id=\"share-link\" d=\"M840 514 C1000 514 973 388 1122 388\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2858ed\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n <g id=\"public-form\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"><rect x=\"1150\" y=\"229\" width=\"604\" height=\"655\" rx=\"34\" class=\"card\"/><rect x=\"1150\" y=\"229\" width=\"604\" height=\"13\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/><text x=\"1197\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"43\" font-weight=\"700\">Client intake</text><text x=\"1198\" y=\"396\" class=\"small\">Full name</text><rect x=\"1198\" y=\"419\" width=\"508\" height=\"71\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4f5f0\" stroke=\"#dce1d9\"/><text x=\"1198\" y=\"552\" class=\"small\">Work email</text><rect x=\"1198\" y=\"575\" width=\"508\" height=\"71\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4f5f0\" stroke=\"#dce1d9\"/><g id=\"submit-button\"><rect x=\"1198\" y=\"704\" width=\"508\" height=\"81\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/><text x=\"1452\" y=\"755\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"white\">Submit</text></g></g>\n <g id=\"respondent-note\"><circle cx=\"131\" cy=\"790\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e1ead3\"/><path d=\"M125 790 L130 795 L139 784\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#40613a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"801\" font-size=\"31\">No AI account needed to respond.</text></g>\n</g>\n\n<!-- Read: responses return to the AI conversation. -->\n<g id=\"s4\" class=\"scene\">\n <g id=\"read-copy\"><text x=\"114\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"87\" class=\"headline\">Keep the conversation going.</text><text x=\"119\" y=\"366\" class=\"body muted\">Ask your AI to read the responses.</text></g>\n <g id=\"response-papers\"><rect x=\"142\" y=\"500\" width=\"340\" height=\"330\" rx=\"24\" fill=\"#dfe6d2\" transform=\"rotate(-8 312 665)\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"471\" width=\"340\" height=\"330\" rx=\"24\" fill=\"#dce5ff\" transform=\"rotate(6 340 636)\"/><rect x=\"193\" y=\"487\" width=\"340\" height=\"330\" rx=\"24\" class=\"card\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"549\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"600\">Responses</text><path d=\"M229 593 H486 M229 646 H486 M229 699 H413\" stroke=\"#c8d1c3\" stroke-width=\"13\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"479\" cy=\"772\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#e4ecd7\"/><path d=\"M469 772 L477 780 L491 764\" stroke=\"#4a6c3c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n <path id=\"return-link\" d=\"M574 649 H866\" stroke=\"#2858ed\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n <g id=\"read-conversation\"><rect x=\"916\" y=\"454\" width=\"865\" height=\"159\" rx=\"27\" fill=\"#18292b\"/><text x=\"962\" y=\"519\" font-size=\"36\" class=\"white\">Summarize the responses</text><text x=\"962\" y=\"568\" font-size=\"36\" class=\"white\">to my client intake form.</text><g id=\"read-answer\"><rect x=\"916\" y=\"640\" width=\"865\" height=\"182\" rx=\"27\" fill=\"#e2e9d9\"/><circle cx=\"968\" cy=\"695\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/><text x=\"1002\" y=\"705\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"600\">Your answers, in the same chat.</text><text x=\"962\" y=\"766\" font-size=\"29\" class=\"muted\">Read submissions. Export as CSV.</text></g></g>\n</g>\n\n<!-- Brand close with a readable hold. -->\n<g id=\"s5\" class=\"scene\">\n <rect id=\"final-panel\" x=\"74\" y=\"197\" width=\"1772\" height=\"786\" rx=\"49\" fill=\"#2858ed\"/>\n <g id=\"final-copy\"><text x=\"150\" y=\"384\" font-size=\"101\" class=\"headline white\">Your next form,</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"503\" font-size=\"101\" class=\"headline white\">starts with a sentence.</text><text x=\"156\" y=\"594\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#dce5ff\" style=\"fill:#dce5ff\">Build, publish and read responses in your AI.</text></g>\n <g id=\"final-steps\"><text x=\"158\" y=\"714\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#dce5ff\" style=\"fill:#dce5ff\">Describe</text><path d=\"M303 704 H363 M355 696 L364 704 L355 712\" stroke=\"#a9bdff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"398\" y=\"714\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#dce5ff\" style=\"fill:#dce5ff\">Share</text><path d=\"M516 704 H576 M568 696 L577 704 L568 712\" stroke=\"#a9bdff\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"611\" y=\"714\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#dce5ff\" style=\"fill:#dce5ff\">Read</text></g>\n <g id=\"cta\"><rect x=\"153\" y=\"790\" width=\"427\" height=\"105\" rx=\"22\" fill=\"#f5f3eb\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"855\" font-size=\"41\" font-weight=\"600\">brieform.app</text><path d=\"M508 842 H537 M526 830 L538 842 L526 854\" stroke=\"#2858ed\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g>\n <g id=\"final-symbol\" transform=\"translate(1440 690)\"><rect x=\"-25\" y=\"-25\" width=\"235\" height=\"235\" rx=\"39\" fill=\"#3e6cf3\" transform=\"rotate(12 92 92)\"/><rect width=\"185\" height=\"210\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#f5f3eb\"/><path d=\"M40 58 H143 M40 94 H143 M40 130 H108\" stroke=\"#2858ed\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"161\" cy=\"183\" r=\"43\" fill=\"#dfeacb\"/><path d=\"M142 183 L155 196 L181 168\" stroke=\"#36572d\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n 'use strict';\n const tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});\n // Every initial state and motion lives on this single seekable timeline.\n tl.set('.scene',{opacity:0},0)\n   .set('#s1',{opacity:1},0)\n   .fromTo('#hero-title',{y:200},{y:0,duration:1.05,ease:'power3.out'},0.1)\n   .fromTo('#hero-sub',{opacity:0,y:25},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.65},.65)\n   .fromTo('#hero-pill',{opacity:0,y:18},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.6},1.05)\n   .fromTo('#hero-art',{opacity:0,y:80,rotation:5,svgOrigin:'1450 540'},{opacity:1,y:0,rotation:0,duration:1.1,ease:'power3.out'},.2)\n   .fromTo('#hero-fields rect',{scaleX:.25,transformOrigin:'left center'},{scaleX:1,stagger:.12,duration:.7,ease:'power2.out'},1.05)\n   .to('#hero-art',{y:-14,duration:2.2,ease:'sine.inOut'},2)\n   .to('#s1',{opacity:0,y:-28,duration:.4,ease:'power2.in'},4.75)\n   .fromTo('#s2',{opacity:0,y:35},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.5,ease:'power2.out'},5.05)\n   .fromTo('#prompt-card',{x:-40},{x:0,duration:.65,ease:'power3.out'},5.3)\n   .fromTo('#prompt-reveal',{attr:{width:0}},{attr:{width:720},duration:1.5,ease:'none'},5.6)\n   .fromTo('#build-link',{strokeDasharray:150,strokeDashoffset:150},{strokeDashoffset:0,duration:.45},7)\n   .fromTo('#build-card',{opacity:0,y:35},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.65,ease:'power3.out'},7.25)\n   .fromTo('.build-field',{opacity:0,y:14},{opacity:1,y:0,stagger:.24,duration:.45},7.6)\n   .fromTo('#ready',{opacity:0},{opacity:1,duration:.35},8.7)\n   .fromTo('#describe-footer',{opacity:0,y:10},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.5},8.7)\n   .to('#s2',{opacity:0,y:-28,duration:.4},11.05)\n   .fromTo('#s3',{opacity:0,y:30},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.5},11.35)\n   .fromTo('#share-url',{opacity:0,x:-35},{opacity:1,x:0,duration:.6,ease:'power3.out'},11.8)\n   .fromTo('#share-link',{strokeDasharray:360,strokeDashoffset:360},{strokeDashoffset:0,duration:.65},12.3)\n   .fromTo('#public-form',{opacity:0,x:40},{opacity:1,x:0,duration:.7,ease:'power3.out'},12.7)\n   .fromTo('#share-options',{opacity:0,y:15},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.5},13.15)\n   .fromTo('#respondent-note',{opacity:0,y:15},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.6},13.6)\n   .fromTo('#submit-button',{scale:.95,svgOrigin:'1452 744'},{scale:1,duration:.6,ease:'back.out(1.5)'},14)\n   .to('#s3',{opacity:0,y:-28,duration:.4},17.05)\n   .fromTo('#s4',{opacity:0,y:30},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.5},17.35)\n   .fromTo('#response-papers',{opacity:0,y:45,rotation:-4,svgOrigin:'340 650'},{opacity:1,y:0,rotation:0,duration:.75,ease:'power3.out'},17.7)\n   .fromTo('#return-link',{strokeDasharray:300,strokeDashoffset:300},{strokeDashoffset:0,duration:.65},18.3)\n   .fromTo('#read-conversation',{opacity:0,x:35},{opacity:1,x:0,duration:.65,ease:'power3.out'},18.8)\n   .fromTo('#read-answer',{opacity:0,y:22},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.65,ease:'power2.out'},20)\n   .to('#s4',{opacity:0,y:-25,duration:.4},23.35)\n   .fromTo('#s5',{opacity:0},{opacity:1,duration:.5},23.65)\n   .fromTo('#final-panel',{scaleY:.1,svgOrigin:'960 590'},{scaleY:1,duration:.8,ease:'power3.inOut'},23.65)\n   .fromTo('#final-copy',{opacity:0,y:38},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.75,ease:'power3.out'},24.25)\n   .fromTo('#final-steps',{opacity:0,y:16},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.6},24.95)\n   .fromTo('#cta',{opacity:0,y:22},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.65,ease:'power3.out'},25.35)\n   .fromTo('#final-symbol',{opacity:0,y:40},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.8,ease:'power3.out'},25.4)\n   .fromTo('#texture',{x:0},{x:-30,duration:30,ease:'none'},0)\n   .fromTo('#ambient',{attr:{cx:1770,cy:900}},{attr:{cx:1690,cy:815},duration:30,ease:'none'},0)\n   .to({}, {duration:3},27);\n window.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};\n window.__timelines['main']=tl;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","width":1920,"height":1080,"duration_seconds":30,"assumptions":["Brieform refers to the AI form builder at https://brieform.app/. Product workflow verified using its official homepage and https://brieform.app/mcp.","Chosen format: 1920×1080 landscape, 30 seconds, silent presentation with five scenes.","Cream, blue and sage art direction is an original presentation treatment. Editable vector workflow illustrations are conceptual diagrams, not product screenshots; no customer data or performance figures are represented.","Product claims cover creating forms in supported AI clients, publishing and sharing forms, and reading responses or exporting CSV. Sources: [Official homepage](https://brieform.app/) and [Official MCP overview](https://brieform.app/mcp).","No external imagery, logos, fonts or audio assets are used. Brieform and third-party product names retain their owners’ trademark rights; no brand license was supplied. GSAP is supplied locally by the harness.","This source has not been rendered or visually reviewed."],"missing_inputs":[],"summary":"Complete editable 30-second Brieform presentation with researched product messaging and one paused GSAP timeline."}